<title>USA: Identix amends fiscal Q2,Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Identix amends fiscal Q2,Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indentix Inc said Monday it has restated its revenues and earnings for the second and third quarters in 1996, showing lower-than-previously announced figures for that period.</p>
<p>The revisions were made to reflect changes in the way the company analyzed a &quot;number of the company's contractural relationships in its law-enforcement business,&quot; Indentix Chairman, President and Chief Executive Randall Fowler said in a statement.</p>
</text>
